  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.0.8\n\n## Changes (initial history)\n\n- Fix MMC3 frame runs through OAM DMA (#7) (`43f559b`)\n- Add deterministic PPU observability (#5) (`8e09f30`)\n- fix(mcp): resolve DI circular dependency that hung every NES tool call (#4) (`c67ee43`)\n- docs: add emulator license notices (`2d162e5`)\n- feat: complete AprNes debug workflows (`ab902d0`)\n- feat: add AprNes backend for mapper support (`21b956e`)\n- feat: support four-screen nametable VRAM (`24f1a67`)\n- feat: align NES MCP debug workflows with Game Boy (`9283f4c`)\n- feat: align NES MCP debug tools with Game Boy (`460708f`)\n- feat: add NES debug MCP server (`e9ffa71`)\n",
